    "legend": "A young man presented with a rapidly growing, smooth-surfaced nodule with keratotic centre typical for a keratoacanthoma on the nasal alar. His father died at a young age from colorectal carcinoma, and a paternal cousin has Muir&ndash;Torre syndrome.",
    "source": "Richard A. Carr",
